encoding  utf-8
survey Roaring

###Inputs, add surveys here###
input 1/Roaring1.th


###Joins, connecting scraps on the surveys###
#join S1@subsurvey1 S1@subsurvey2


###Equates, connecting points on surveys###
#equate 9@subsurvey1 1@subsurvey2


###Map, to create overall map. Input individual survey maps to create the whole###
map plan -projection plan
  plan@Roaring1
endmap

endsurvey

